OL,3,GNEWSAWhat is happening with the Jackdaw
OL,4,Aand Rosebank gas and oil fields?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Jackdaw gas field in the North Sea
OL,7,Fhas been allowed to start production
OL,8,Fafter years of debates and legal
OL,9,Fwrangling - but a decision is yet to be
OL,10,Ftaken on the Rosebank oil field off
OL,11,FShetland.
OL,13,FIndustry bodies argue that the sites
OL,14,Fcould provide jobs and improve the UK's
OL,15,Fenergy security as overseas conflicts
OL,16,Fthreaten supply.
OL,23,APub: 10-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,423,420,260,160,0,100
