OL,3,GNEWSAWhat is happening with the Jackdaw
OL,4,Aand Rosebank gas and oil fields?
OL,5,
OL,6,FEnvironmentalists insist that more
OL,7,Fdrilling would be unconscionable,
OL,8,Fhampering efforts to cut planet-warming
OL,9,Fcarbon emissions as deadly heatwaves
OL,10,Fand extreme weather affect billions
OL,11,Facross the globe.
OL,13,FThey also say starting production would
OL,14,Fnot protect energy security and that
OL,15,Ftransitioning sooner to greener
OL,16,Ftechnologies would be better for
OL,17,Fsupporting jobs.
OL,23,APub: 10-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
